                        ],
                        "form": "antropoloogjes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                        "entry_id": "b501d2a1-755d-303a-9084-723fd5708ff4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een wetenschapper die zich bezighoudt met het bestuderen van het menselijk gedrag"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "beroep"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0b5ea67-b5a3-45f4-9dcc-aa1cf0fdd6bf",
                                "sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                                "text": "De veel gepubliceerde bewering dat Homo naledi, een vroegere mensensoort met een klein brein, zijn overledenen begroef en rotskunst maakte, is volgens een groep onderzoekers volledig ongegrond. ‘Er is totaal geen bewijs voor’, zegt archeoloog en antropoloog Michael Petraglia van de Griffith-universiteit in Australië."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7014811f-91b8-4abe-939c-ac1caac743cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "b501d2a1-755d-303a-9084-723fd5708ff4",
                        "source_sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anthropologe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anthropologe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e87cbe67-188d-3963-843f-86bbab290ffa",
                                        "entry_id": "ed828e9a-9353-3424-8386-d7a0af9edb0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Wissenschaftler, der sich mit der Anthropologie beschäftigt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9592cb3-3007-40bc-a758-fb153b2a66ea",
                                                "sense_id": "e87cbe67-188d-3963-843f-86bbab290ffa",
                                                "text": "„Die Anthropologen konnten nachweisen, dass der Besitzer mit etwa 25 bis 30 Jahren starb.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcd9fa06-ed86-4305-85ac-31f3ed0a84df",
                                                "sense_id": "e87cbe67-188d-3963-843f-86bbab290ffa",
                                                "text": "„Der Anthropologe Jomo Kenyatta, charismatischer Führer der KAU und Teil des gemäßigten Flügels, distanziert sich von den Mau-Mau und fordert ein Ende der Gewalt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0fee1f7-1f03-4859-9e38-ee8cc47d5a14",
                                                "sense_id": "e87cbe67-188d-3963-843f-86bbab290ffa",
                                                "text": "„Frühe Archäologen und Anthropologen fanden immer mehr Ähnlichkeiten zwischen den indigenen Bevölkerungen der polaren Regionen Sibiriens, Nordamerikas und Grönlands.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a21cbb5-1082-4117-bc27-2830a1855919",
                                                "sense_id": "e87cbe67-188d-3963-843f-86bbab290ffa",
                                                "text": "„Außerdem befassen sich noch die Althistoriker mit den Kelten, die die Berichte antiker Autoren auswerten, sowie Genetiker und Anthropologen, die versuchen, aus Knochen und anderen biologischen Materialien Befunde abzuleiten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8bcba11a-f81c-4bf3-b5f2-02debc3dedf1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b501d2a1-755d-303a-9084-723fd5708ff4",
                        "source_sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthropologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthropologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4783801-7bb1-336d-bf5d-ea2f3b3c78b1",
                                        "entry_id": "7c29e4ac-ff69-3302-aaff-7381c9b955dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expert in anthropology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2185cf1-c954-48a8-867e-98b81ac5a4f5",
                                                "sense_id": "a4783801-7bb1-336d-bf5d-ea2f3b3c78b1",
                                                "text": "In actual fact, it is hard to see how anyone could defend the prescriptive approach. In any other field of enquiry, it would be seen as patently absurd. What would we say of the social anthropologist who, instead of describing the way a given society is, sets about prescribing the way he thinks it ought to be? (We'd probably suggest he ought to give up Anthropology and take up Politics!) [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4572b15a-f938-4e73-9eb5-f9eccd453a46",
                                                "sense_id": "a4783801-7bb1-336d-bf5d-ea2f3b3c78b1",
                                                "text": "In traditional anthropology, somebody goes to another country, says: “How fascinating these people are! How interesting their tools and their culture are,” and then they write a paper, and maybe a few other anthropologists read it, and we think these cultures are very exotic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d574dec-143f-4a81-8bfd-b474349a8cf1",
                                                "sense_id": "a4783801-7bb1-336d-bf5d-ea2f3b3c78b1",
                                                "text": "But again, this conflates global geographic variation with race, says Alan Goodman, a biological anthropologist at Hampshire College."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb0f9067-21ff-43bd-b661-0cff49eb08c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "b501d2a1-755d-303a-9084-723fd5708ff4",
                        "source_sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthropologue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthropologue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "343e1afb-e124-35f7-b16b-6fd858518220",
                                        "entry_id": "f2eee5ff-a30a-3578-9626-d673d73de2c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Spécialiste de l’anthropologie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0187af54-9653-4011-9019-ec2cb87d6a8a",
                                                "sense_id": "343e1afb-e124-35f7-b16b-6fd858518220",
                                                "text": "Comme il s’agissait de l’alimentation de base de cette mère, je me devais, en tant qu’anthropologue, de respecter la culture locale et de ne pas intervenir dans une pratique alimentaire si répandue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d139b3c1-c1c9-4d26-b619-5b8664866055",
                                                "sense_id": "343e1afb-e124-35f7-b16b-6fd858518220",
                                                "text": "Or, ce que je vais découvrir en Amazonie, c’est le processus de destruction des environnements que l’on qualifie de “naturels”… mais qui sont en partie le produit d’actions humaines, comme l’ont montré mes travaux et ceux d’autres anthropologues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2a0c873-d971-4102-9100-9c1bfcfca972",
                                                "sense_id": "343e1afb-e124-35f7-b16b-6fd858518220",
                                                "text": "« Il y a sans doute un tabou encore un peu prégnant à Noël, mais je crois que la tendance va se démocratiser au fur et à mesure », estime Dominique Desjeux, anthropologue spécialiste de la consommation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe65e545-1d27-4ab2-96d3-ff0b18aba50c",
                        "source_entry_id": "b501d2a1-755d-303a-9084-723fd5708ff4",
                        "source_sense_id": "621e1701-730b-3dd0-9930-8e580574db9b",
                        "target_lang_word": "antropólogo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antropólogo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a96f6b8-8122-3b6f-8061-a04403e063ad",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd8b9b0-279b-381b-9009-4555b06322d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Persona que se dedica a la antropología (ciencia social que estudia todas las dimensiones del ser humano) o tiene mucho conocimiento de esta materia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6747d070-341f-40df-8e00-bd4dabf4fe25",
                                                "sense_id": "6a96f6b8-8122-3b6f-8061-a04403e063ad",
                                                "text": "Si hubiese sido ya antropólogo entonces el hijo de Recalde, hubiera encontrado, probablemente, que todos ellos tenían la cabeza redonda y que por eso eran tan absolutistas y violentos"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
